---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Systems | Griffith Creative"
  description="We help companies build the systems that suit how they actually work. Storage, software, and the workflows between them, reviewed and rebuilt around the team."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container-site">
      <p class="eyebrow mb-7">Systems</p>
      <h1 class="h1 mb-7">Systems.</h1>
      <p class="lede mb-8">
        We help companies build the systems that suit how they actually work: storage, software, and the workflows between them.
      </p>
      <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-primary">Book a call</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container-site">
      <div class="stacked">
      <h2 class="h2">The review</h2>
      <p class="para">
        Most companies run on systems nobody chose. Tools were added one at a time, files went wherever there was room, and the way work moves between people was never designed. Over two weeks we sit with your team, learn how the work really happens, and write up what is helping, what is in the way, and what it all costs.
      </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container-site two-col">
      <h2 class="h2">The rebuild</h2>
      <p class="para">
        Then we build the version that fits. Archives go somewhere they can be found. Overlapping tools become one. The hand-offs people do by hand start happening on their own. Scoped from the review, priced in writing, and built around the way your team already works.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container-site">
      <h2 class="h2 mb-8">What we work with</h2>
      <ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-2.5 mb-8" aria-label="Platforms">
        <li class="tag">Google Workspace</li>
        <li class="tag">Microsoft 365</li>
        <li class="tag">Dropbox</li>
        <li class="tag">Box</li>
        <li class="tag">Amazon Web Services</li>
        <li class="tag">Azure</li>
        <li class="tag">Google Cloud</li>
        <li class="tag">Adobe Creative Cloud</li>
        <li class="tag">Slack</li>
        <li class="tag">Notion</li>
        <li class="tag">Airtable</li>
        <li class="tag">HubSpot</li>
        <li class="tag">Salesforce</li>
        <li class="tag">QuickBooks</li>
        <li class="tag">Xero</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="para">If your company runs on it, we have most likely worked in it. If not, we learn it before we touch it.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section py-24 md:py-32">
    <div class="container-site">
      <h2 class="h2-close mb-8">Systems that work the way you do.</h2>
      <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-primary">Book a call</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
